    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Beta Access</h1><p>Released June 2023</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lonely Mystic got tired of playing board games alone - what better solution than to bring the figurines to life in VR! Play as the Mystic (the game master) or one of the dungeon crawling Warriors, taking on quests using classic RPG elements to battle enemies and discover surprises along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet up with friends to go on a role-playing adventure together to complete quests while battling enemies and overcoming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate dynamically generated dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize your character\u2019s unique weapons, spells, and actions to join forces and beat the omnipresent game master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from either the Wizard or Sorceress as the game master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from one of the Warrior figurines come-to-life (Fighter, Thief, Cleric, Mage, Dwarf, Elf)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tabletop Warriors is a VR game made to be played with friends but can be played solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tabletop Warriors is designed to be used on devices that support OpenXR - such as the Valve Index, Oculus Rift, and the Meta Quest (using the Meta Quest Link software).\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lonely Mystic got tired of playing board games alone - what better solution than to bring the figurines to life in VR! Play as the Mystic (the game master) or one of the dungeon crawling Warriors, taking on quests using classic RPG elements to battle enemies and discover surprises along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet up with friends to go on a role-playing adventure together to complete quests while battling enemies and overcoming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate dynamically generated dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize your character\u2019s unique weapons, spells, and actions to join forces and beat the omnipresent game master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from either the Wizard or Sorceress as the game master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from one of the Warrior figurines come-to-life (Fighter, Thief, Cleric, Mage, Dwarf, Elf)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tabletop Warriors is a VR game made to be played with friends but can be played solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tabletop Warriors is designed to be used on devices that support OpenXR - such as the Valve Index, Oculus Rift, and the Meta Quest (using the Meta Quest Link software).\u00a0</p>",
